  "unit_note": "USD millions. Pages 30-31, Table 6 Schedule E, Guaranteed Loan Financing Activity. Seven lines print only dots and (**) and are left out: Agricultural Resource Conservation Demonstration Program, HUD Community Development Loans, the Federal Highway Administration's TIFIA fund, Treasury's Air Transportation Stabilization Fund and Troubled Assets Insurance Financing Fund, and both Microenterprise and Small Enterprise Development lines. On p30 the FHA-General and Special Risk Fund prior-year figure (-201) and the Home Ownership Preservation Entity Fund prior-year (**) sit on a shifted baseline. The page prints 'Health Education Assitance Loans'; the label uses 'Assistance' as earlier months do. 36 sums (30 exact, 4 within 1, 2 within 2; rounding note on p32); the six column sums add all 37 lines. The total's transaction columns equal Table 6's Net Activity, Guaranteed Loan Financing line on p23. Its balance columns (18,183 / 18,183 / 18,363) differ from that line's (147,081 / 147,081 / 147,262), as the two also differ in the May to September statements; no note on p23 or pp30-32 explains the difference.",
